---
/**
 * D9-p — / (root redirect)
 *
 * Redirects bare `/` to `/ko/` using Astro.redirect() for a proper HTTP 302.
 * This generates a static redirect file in dist/ (Astro static output mode).
 *
 * Design §1.1: "Redirect rule: `/` → `/ko/` (HTTP 302 via public/_redirects)"
 * Using Astro.redirect() is preferred over meta-refresh for static builds
 * as it emits a proper redirect response.
 *
 * Note: public/_redirects may also carry this rule for Cloudflare Pages;
 * this file is the Astro-side implementation.
 */
return Astro.redirect('/ko/', 302);
---
